TIP:  The version that follows is based on Michael Martin Murphey's rendition but the music is the same (except Robert capo's one fret lower than Michael) and the lyrics and pacing differences are very minor. 

TIP:  The song is sharped mid-way through so slide the capo up one fret to continue playing with the recording where indicated.  
  

